      "weight": 1,
      "description": "<p><strong>Necromantic Backlash</strong>: Your body becomes a conduit for death magic. All living creatures within Willpower Bonus yards (including you) lose 2d10 W irrespective of Toughness and Armour Points, and they must pass a <strong>Hard (-20) Endurance</strong> Test or lose [[1d10]] Toughness permanently as their life force is drained. You gain [[1d3]] Corruption points and age [[2d10]] years instantly, your hair turning white and skin becoming corpse-like.</p>",
