      "weight": 1,
      "description": "<p><strong>The Grave Calls</strong>: You are partially pulled into the realm of death. For [[1d10]] hours, you exist between life and death: you cannot heal wounds naturally, gain the <strong>Undead</strong> trait, and cause @Fear[2]. Animals automatically flee. If you die during this time, you rise as a Wight within [[1d10]] rounds unless properly sanctified.</p>",
