      "description": "<p><strong>Soul Rot</strong>: Your soul begins to decay while you still live. Reduce all Characteristics by 10 (minimum 1) for [[1d10]] days. Each day, you must pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test or the duration extends by another day. While afflicted, you appear increasingly corpse-like, smell of decay, and animals refuse to approach you. If you reach 0 in any Characteristic, you die and immediately rise as a Wight with a burning hatred for all living things.</p>",
